Package: edgeai-test-data
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: TI EdgeAI test images and demo videos
 Sample images and videos for use with TI EdgeAI inference pipelines and
 demonstration applications (edgeai-gst-apps, edgeai-tiovx-apps).
 .
 Includes test images for classification, detection, and segmentation tasks,
 plus out-of-box demo video clips for GStreamer-based demos.
 .
 Installed to /opt/edgeai-test-data/ and /opt/oob-demo-assets/.
 .
 Compatible with: j721e, j721s2, j784s4, j722s, am62axx.
